{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如元小發軫、學小久\n習、小不定性等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如開住果為兩，佛道應化亦各開二，謂別、圓、地、\n住等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
