{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并以根利故，但敘鹿園事為所開，不須指昔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此以根鈍故，仍述往昔事為所開，必假指昔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二篇上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三索之相，大略如此，委如\n疏記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此因騰舊機情二索，故云加耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二篇上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊謂限其所稟，亦齊已分之所歷，即二乘人稟小教曆五時也。或齊化身，用事則局，亦通\n一代，不唯化故。探謂過其所齊，即未起化前，凡法身所照皆是也。約時雖探，法不異前，齊\n小則小，齊大則大，皆皆領之，故曰二領也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若自它法相權實義門，如常所明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言本迹二序，若通別二序，則非所問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略如妙疏所引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問見精微云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見大論云云"}
